--- !u!1001 &1078260846
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0]
      value: Hello my friend
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1]
      value: The Vikings want to trick you, do not dare to pull the lever
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2]
      value: Yes, they want to use your gift to gain power, the lever is their ancient
        artifact, which they cannot activate
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3]
      value: If you activate the lever, they will get all the power and the whole
        world will go under water
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1043936208367258985, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4]
      value: Make it correct
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2841261712835619626, guid: b6500afb0f59a2440ad7354e9f83a607, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
